Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:33.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Don't give up, if I'm determined{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:33.76,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Don't give up kakugo kimetano nara{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.80,0:00:37.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I'll never turn back{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.80,0:00:37.01,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}hikikaeshi wa shinai sa{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.05,0:00:40.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Laugh on through troubled waters{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.05,0:00:40.31,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}waraitobase aranami{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.56,0:00:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Shout it out, to save your spirit from breaking{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.56,0:00:45.10,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Shout it out kokoro kudakenai youni{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.14,0:00:47.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Your friends are there for you{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.14,0:00:47.56,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}nakama ga irun da{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.60,0:00:53.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Hey, you don't ever need to act tough{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.60,0:00:53.99,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}hora tsuyogari nante iranai itsudatte{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.03,0:00:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Even when the darkness tries to tear you apart{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.03,0:00:58.07,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}yami ga hikisakou toshitemo{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.12,0:00:59.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Come on, brave it out{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.12,0:00:59.37,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}hora Brave it out{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.41,0:01:00.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It's going to be all right{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.41,0:01:00.87,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}daijoubu sa{\i}
