Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.59,0:01:21.51,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}chikai atsumeta hata{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:24.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Keep fighting on{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:24.22,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}tatakai tsudukete iku{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.27,0:01:28.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Stay true to yourself{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.27,0:01:28.98,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}"jibunjishin" tsuranuke{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.02,0:01:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Seize it, dreamin' on{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.02,0:01:33.32,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}tsukami toru Dreamin' on{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.73,0:01:38.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I can't lose, I'll never run away{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.73,0:01:38.70,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}makerarenai nige ya shinai{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.36,0:01:42.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Transcend meetings and partings and keep going{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.36,0:01:42.20,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}deai wakare koe ikou{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.24,0:01:46.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}They're all treasures{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.24,0:01:46.54,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}zenbu takaramono{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.96,0:01:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Open the borderless map{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.96,0:01:49.75,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}mugendai no chizu hiroge{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.79,0:01:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Towards the place that has no end{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.79,0:01:52.88,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}hateshinai ano basho e{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.92,0:01:57.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Have the courage to take a step forward{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.92,0:01:57.59,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}fumidase yuuki no ippo{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.63,0:02:01.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Raise your fist{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.63,0:02:01.76,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}ko wo agete{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.48,0:02:15.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}41 years ago.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.78,0:02:20.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}There was a man who created trouble in the Land of Wano\Nnamed Kozuki Oden.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.16,0:02:23.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}His followers came together,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.16,0:02:29.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}and he stepped into the lawless land, Kuri.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.67,0:02:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}"Changing Destiny!\NThe Whitebeard Pirates Cast Ashore!"{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.01,0:02:46.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're Kozuki Oden, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.39,0:02:53.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've been disavowed,\Nso I no longer have a name!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.65,0:02:57.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyone can enter,\Nbut those who try to leave will be killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.82,0:03:00.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Especially samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.41,0:03:08.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It is so restrictive!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.16,0:03:14.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How can anyone live in a place like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.79,0:03:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.00,0:03:21.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll never be able to get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.34,0:03:23.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, don't even try to get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.85,0:03:26.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"Don't even try to get out"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.72,0:03:30.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's my least favorite rule!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.56,0:03:33.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I make rules in this area!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.19,0:03:35.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cut him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.18,0:04:11.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you the boss?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.11,0:04:29.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oden... I'm gonna kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.91,0:04:32.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Try your best!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.87,0:04:36.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oden-{\i1}san{\i}!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.17,0:04:39.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oden-{\i1}san{\i}!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.50,0:04:41.92,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,KURI
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.17,0:04:43.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look! The gate has been broken!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.97,0:04:55.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You fools who grew up pampered in the capital...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.60,0:04:58.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...can't understand what it\Nfeels like to live in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.06,0:05:02.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that what you wanna say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.36,0:05:09.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna kill you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.87,0:05:14.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop barking in a small yard like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.37,0:05:17.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oden Two-Sword Style!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.87,0:05:20.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Samurai Great Spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.69,0:05:43.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.99,0:05:46.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.24,0:05:51.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oden-{\i1}san{\i}!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.25,0:06:02.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oden-{\i1}san{\i}! We're here to back you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.97,0:06:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.68,0:06:12.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've just finished it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.68,0:06:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It took me a whole day, all through the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.44,0:06:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kill me already!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.86,0:06:30.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know what the future holds anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.28,0:06:33.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have no regrets!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.16,0:06:38.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's the infamous Ashura Doji?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.87,0:06:41.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.42,0:06:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you still love me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.47,0:06:52.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Help me with your wisdom and strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.93,0:06:57.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've decided to head up this helpless scum...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.93,0:07:00.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...as their king!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.65,0:07:07.32,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,FLOWER CAPITAL
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.45,0:07:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shogun-{\i1}sama{\i}! It's Oden-{\i1}sama{\i} again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.37,0:07:19.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? What did he do this time?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.54,0:07:22.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.92,0:07:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That lawless Kuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.84,0:07:33.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Only he could do this...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.05,0:07:36.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this all true?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.31,0:07:44.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Leading the roughnecks of Kuri,\Nthe bloody, hellish land,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.69,0:07:52.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Oden utilized their abundant energy\Nand turned the wild land into a habitable place.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.54,0:08:04.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}In reaction to this accomplishment,\NKozuki Sukiyaki, the Shogun, dropped his disavowal,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.75,0:08:08.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}and gave his son the title\Nof the Daimyo of Kuri.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.00,0:08:12.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Our great Oden-{\i1}sama{\i}\Nwill become the Daimyo of Kuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.80,0:08:14.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.18,0:08:16.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then it'll become a full-fledged province!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.55,0:08:20.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe it! But we stuck it out, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.23,0:08:25.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kin-{\i1}chan{\i}...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.07,0:08:31.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Congratulations! Our precious Oden-{\i1}san{\i}!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.61,0:08:32.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.57,0:08:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--You're amazing, Oden-san!\N--You finally became Kuri's...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.36,0:08:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.50,0:08:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.92,0:08:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daimyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.31,0:09:11.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oden-{\i1}sama{\i}! Oden-{\i1}sama{\i}! Oden-{\i1}sama{\i}! Oden-{\i1}sama{\i}!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.61,0:09:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oden-{\i1}sama{\i}! Oden-{\i1}sama{\i}! Oden-{\i1}sama{\i}!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.66,0:09:25.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong, Ashura?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.50,0:09:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.34,0:09:34.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...have never seen peace before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.38,0:09:38.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.26,0:09:41.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it! Don't creep me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.73,0:09:48.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.27,0:09:51.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.32,0:09:53.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.73,0:09:55.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I said "Stop"!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.74,0:09:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.11,0:09:59.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.74,0:10:01.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Knock it off already!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.20,0:10:04.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, a Daimyo needs vassals.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.83,0:10:09.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rather than being assigned with\Nsome wise and sober men,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.54,0:10:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.56,0:10:26.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Be my samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.12,0:10:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oden-{\i1}sama{\i}!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.83,0:10:56.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,S-S-Stop! You're snotting! It's coming out!\NOh, it's on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.38,0:10:58.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.30,0:11:02.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Then, six years later...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.09,0:11:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}33 years before the present day,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.10,0:11:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}elsewhere across the world,\Nthe remnants of the disbanded legendary Rocks Pirates...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.94,0:11:18.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}...each formed a new crew,\Nextended their influence, and became infamous.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.03,0:11:27.79,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,BEACH OF KURI, LAND OF WANO
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.99,0:11:30.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are they animals?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.25,0:11:33.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just hairy men?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.80,0:11:40.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Odd-shaped creatures?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.81,0:11:49.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Did you get it?\N--Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.12,0:12:15.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Far back, several hundred years ago,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.29,0:12:20.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}we Minks\Nand the Kozuki samurai of the Land of Wano...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.67,0:12:24.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}...made a pledge and became sworn allies.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.55,0:12:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn! The Land of Wano is the worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.60,0:12:30.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Dammit! Get me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.23,0:12:33.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a kappa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.10,0:12:35.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you're an imp!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.56,0:12:39.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--I wish we never set sail!\N--I wish we didn't come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.15,0:12:43.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Screw that sworn ally crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.53,0:12:46.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A cat monster, dog monster, and a kappa...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.57,0:12:50.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is this beach cursed? Let's burn them alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.66,0:12:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.59,0:13:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I got enough ingredients for today's {\i1}oden{\i}...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.93,0:13:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.15,0:13:24.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shame on you, you pricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.19,0:13:27.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You fear those who aren't like you\Nbecause you're ignorant!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.57,0:13:30.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How could you bully those little ones?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.95,0:13:34.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.25,0:13:38.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.46,0:13:40.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't leave us like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.88,0:13:49.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who are those little creatures?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.93,0:13:51.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They followed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.64,0:13:56.14,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,DOGSTORM - A MINK
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.85,0:13:56.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for saving us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.19,0:13:59.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.40,0:14:04.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,On top of hunger and the shipwreck,\Nwe were almost killed by violence!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.60,0:14:03.02,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,CAT VIPER - A MINK
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.82,0:14:05.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.78,0:14:07.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! This is too hot to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.11,0:14:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa... I can't get used to\Nseeing animals talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.66,0:14:18.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Minks! My father once told me about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.12,0:14:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I thought so!\NWe have that symbol in our country, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.71,0:14:25.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You-{\i1}gara{\i} people and us are brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.59,0:14:28.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And you saved our lives!\NWe were starving...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.88,0:14:31.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see... Eat as much as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.51,0:14:33.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, savior!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.39,0:14:34.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.22,0:14:36.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be shy. You'll like radish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.89,0:14:38.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't forget this favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.73,0:14:39.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.48,0:14:40.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have some {\i1}hanpen{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.48,0:14:42.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.36,0:14:42.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Konnyaku{\i}...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.11,0:14:45.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No! It's too hot to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.86,0:14:52.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have a sensitive tongue!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.07,0:14:55.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You evil cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.49,0:14:57.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, wait, Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.58,0:15:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.17,0:15:03.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Oden{\i} wouldn't be {\i1}oden{\i}...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.79,0:15:07.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...if it wasn't boiled!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.80,0:15:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's kind of cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.34,0:15:14.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To me, it's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.43,0:15:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.93,0:15:20.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The ship we were on sank\Nand my mother and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.06,0:15:23.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...were cast ashore in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.81,0:15:27.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We asked for help, but the people threw rocks at us\Nbecause we were Fish-Men.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.57,0:15:32.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My mother got hurt,\Nso we couldn't go back to where we came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.07,0:15:34.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Before my mother died, she told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.41,0:15:39.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"The Fish-Men suffer discrimination,\Nso claim that you're a kappa."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.33,0:15:48.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Kawamatsu the Kappa.\NI've been living off leftovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.34,0:15:49.17,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,KAWAMATSU - A KAPPA
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.59,0:15:54.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for saving me\Nand treating me to such a delicious meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.01,0:15:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll never forget this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.06,0:15:59.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can I eat all of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.47,0:16:02.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, we'll cook a new one, so wait for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.77,0:16:06.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's not necessary. It's still edible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.23,0:16:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no. I behaved rudely.\NI wasted food.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.07,0:16:14.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.20,0:16:18.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry-{\i1}meow{\i}, Kappa!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.08,0:16:20.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll eat it, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.37,0:16:24.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's still too hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.79,0:16:28.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What a funny cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.00,0:16:32.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.09,0:16:38.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There are still creatures\NI've never seen out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.39,0:16:43.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,By seeing you guys,\NI can't wait to set sail again one day!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.31,0:16:45.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Great!\N--This world is a big place!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.98,0:16:47.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.77,0:16:51.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I mean... Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.41,0:16:56.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let us stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.99,0:16:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Were you listening to us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.49,0:17:00.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We have no place to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.79,0:17:04.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right! All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.08,0:17:07.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yay! Yaaay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.79,0:17:09.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We got more people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.25,0:17:12.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess you can't reject anyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.21,0:17:16.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's fine, but we're in a bind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.38,0:17:20.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You lent money to Orochi without asking me again!\NHe's a scumbag!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.14,0:17:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, he's independent now,\Nbut he's still tied to Yasu-{\i1}san{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.69,0:17:26.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I must help him...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.82,0:17:35.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Without noise, on tiptoe, stealthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.07,0:17:37.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay? Those are the basics.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.57,0:17:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.66,0:17:41.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go! Don't be afraid of Yasuie!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.53,0:17:44.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Without noise, on tiptoe, stealthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.79,0:17:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Without noise, on tiptoe, stealthy...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.01,0:17:56.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you try to steal this much money?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.92,0:17:59.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oden-{\i1}san{\i} is out of money!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.55,0:18:02.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you wanna kill us,\Njust do it, you hedgehog!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.64,0:18:05.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If it'll help Oden-{\i1}san{\i}...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.73,0:18:09.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm happy to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.70,0:18:22.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Oden... he took such strange people in...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.08,0:18:27.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can have the money!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.25,0:18:29.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.00,0:18:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yasuie-{\i1}sama{\i}! What about Hakumai's finances?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.67,0:18:35.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.63,0:18:42.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You guys, use this money.\NI will give it to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.89,0:18:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,More money?! That can't be true!\NIs it a trap?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.90,0:18:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you like Oden?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.69,0:19:03.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Then, use this money to fix yourselves up,\Nlearn good manners,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.28,0:19:06.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}buy books, and get yourself educated.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.25,0:19:10.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That doesn't sound like us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.59,0:19:18.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.42,0:19:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No! Speak from your stomach!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.30,0:19:21.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.43,0:19:32.19,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,RELIGION   HISTORY   ECONOMICS   SAMURAI   MANNERS
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.43,0:19:34.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}With hoodlums like you as vassals,\NOden will humiliate himself.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.31,0:19:38.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oden-{\i1}sama{\i}, will you please elaborate on\Nhow you feel today?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.73,0:19:41.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This {\i1}ganmodoki{\i} is exquisite!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.03,0:19:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong with you guys?!\NYou're so creepy these days!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.24,0:19:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He will become the Shogun of the Land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.20,0:19:55.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Those who support him ought to be\Nthe best samurai in the Land of Wano!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.98,0:20:22.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Of course, you must protect your lord!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.32,0:20:26.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}But someday, be the guardian angels of...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.45,0:20:29.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}...the capital and the whole Land of Wano!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.91,0:20:36.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,THREE YEARS LATER\N30 YEARS BEFORE THE PRESENT DAY
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.71,0:20:40.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The party of Kuri's Daimyo\Nwill come to the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.71,0:20:45.55,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,FLOWER CAPITAL
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.01,0:20:42.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't get robbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.88,0:20:45.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oden-{\i1}sama{\i}'s vassals are ruffians.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.72,0:20:47.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look! They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.85,0:20:50.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.00,0:21:23.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa! What happened to those samurai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.51,0:21:26.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Were Oden-{\i1}sama{\i}'s vassals always that cool?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.68,0:21:28.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, they've changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.39,0:21:31.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's like the Shogun's procession!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.02,0:21:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The regal postures of those samurai were\Nso glorious that some people even forgot to breathe.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.11,0:21:52.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}And one could have seen people's knees\Ngive way everywhere in the capital.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.16,0:21:58.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.54,0:22:02.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oden! You became such a great man!\NEveryone is surprised!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.13,0:22:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've only been made great.\NI haven't changed at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.55,0:22:11.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I-I-I cannot believe\Nyou feel grateful to others!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.85,0:22:13.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be frightened!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.06,0:22:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Hearing about his father's illness, Oden rushed to the capital\Nand was relieved to see him fine.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.65,0:22:32.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}However, this was the last time\Nthey would talk to each other.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.58,0:22:38.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,People are living here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.08,0:22:42.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pops, it'll take a week to repair it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.75,0:22:45.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The cargo is mostly water damaged!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.25,0:22:47.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We need to go get food and supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.25,0:22:49.72,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,SAME YEAR, ITACHI PORT, KURI
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.97,0:22:49.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who wants to go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.93,0:22:53.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Almost everyone\Nsince we all need some exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.64,0:22:55.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm coming, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.39,0:22:58.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't. You're an apprentice!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.69,0:23:01.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We climbed up the falls, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.65,0:23:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why is there sea and an island here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.94,0:23:09.61,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,EDWARD NEWGATE\NCAPTAIN OF THE WHITEBEARD PIRATES
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.41,0:23:23.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Getting in fights and tossed about in raging waves\Ndoesn't deter Oden's ambition!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.46,0:23:28.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}He dreams of the unknown world,\Nand to make his way out, he'll tackle any hardship!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.01,0:23:36.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Will Oden be able to win Whitebeard and his people's hearts\Nand set out for an adventure with them?!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.60,0:23:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,On the next episode of One Piece!\N"Oden's Determination! Whitebeard's Test!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.64,0:23:44.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna become the King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.44,0:23:46.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.44,0:23:48.44,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,
